875
01:36:29,472 --> 01:36:31,400
<i>We got great news today.</i>

876
01:36:31,424 --> 01:36:34,937
<i>President Roosevelt announced
the end of blackouts on Hawaii.</i>

877
01:36:34,961 --> 01:36:38,807
