880
01:36:43,886 --> 01:36:45,865
<i>After a 12-hour
shift, I'm too tired</i>

881
01:36:45,889 --> 01:36:49,017
<i>to do anything
but write letters.</i>

882
01:36:51,076 --> 01:36:52,955
