883
01:36:52,979 --> 01:36:57,493
<i>that the war is going well
and could be over soon.</i>

884
01:36:57,517 --> 01:37:01,530
<i>I think about you
more and more...</i>

885
01:37:01,554 --> 01:37:04,700
<i>if you're alive or
dead out there.</i>

886
01:37:04,724 --> 01:37:06,418
<i>I check the mail every day,</i>

887
01:37:06,442 --> 01:37:09,204
<i>knowing there's
going to be an answer.</i>

888
01:37:09,228 --> 01:37:11,640
<i>Are you reading these, Joe?</i>

889
01:37:11,664 --> 01:37:13,930
